# What `vsce package` leaves out (step 10.9). Everything is bundled into
# dist/ (G9), so this allow-list is the whole .vsix; package.json is always
# included. vsce lets a "!" pattern win over any ignore pattern, whatever
# the order, so the allow-list can't be followed by exclusions: dist/ is
# allowed file by file, which keeps out the esbuild metafiles
# (dist/meta*.json) and any sourcemap. packaging.test.ts checks the result.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/mcp-stdio.js
!media/**
!resources/**
!package.nls.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!icon.png
